&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the developer productivity platform for Stripe&#39;s Terminal team, designing and building the tooling and infrastructure that makes engineers across mobile, backend, and embedded systems faster and more effective.&lt;/p&gt;
