&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Product Marketing Manager to own the positioning, messaging, and go-to-market strategy for Stripe Apps, the App Marketplace, and the broader partner ecosystem. This is a combined role that sits at the intersection of product, partnerships, and marketing — responsible for defining how the world sees Stripe&#39;s ecosystem of apps, integrations, and partner solutions as a strategic differentiator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the value proposition of the App Marketplace and broader partner ecosystem for developers, customers, partners, and internal teams—building distinct messaging for both supply-side partners (those building on Stripe) and demand-side users (those adopting solutions).&lt;/li&gt;
