&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with data. &lt;/strong&gt;You like working with data and insights and pair that with your passion for users to generate balanced and thoughtful points of view for how to take products to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep things organized&lt;/strong&gt;. You are able to manage highly interdependent, complex projects and keep various work streams on track. You&#39;re comfortable running multiple launches in parallel across different product lines and coordinating across Bridge, Privy, and Stripe teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have a passion for fintech and crypto. &lt;/strong&gt;You are keen to learn about how things work and are able to explain technical concepts in ways that everyday people can understand. You’re deeply curious about fintech and crypto and translate that passion into impactful product marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be ambitious and thrive in complexity. &lt;/strong&gt;You are eager to make an impact at Bridge (and consequently, Stripe). You thrive in a fast-moving, dynamic, hyper-growth environment and are able to operate fluidly between the 30,000-foot strategy level and the micro-detail to get things right&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a team player. &lt;/strong&gt;Product Marketers collaborate with basically every team in the business. You are able to work with a range of disciplines to execute on your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
