&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience including B2B product marketing, marketing, product management, and management consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to be agile and thrive in a fast-paced and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
