&lt;p&gt;At Stripe, we want to give every candidate a stellar experience, no matter the outcome of their interview. Our Recruiting Coordination team manages several aspects of recruiting administration to provide a great experience for our candidates, shepherding them through the entire process. Initially on a 11-month fixed term contract, this role will involve playing a key role in the coordination of the interview process across many regions, functions and role types.&lt;/p&gt;
