&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years of in Payments at a leading technology or payments company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience writing SQL to query relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
